  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 6232 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E3", "D1"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The label for our carvedilol product names Bryant Ranch Prepack as the registered plant with FEI 1000519407.",
      "cites": ["E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 590126 of that plant ended on 2009-06-11 and was classified OAI with a known date of 2009-09-09.",
      "cites": ["E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 6232 days before the posting date of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E3", "D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to the same plant on 2010-04-08.",
      "cites": ["E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent inspections from 2010 through 2026-07-16 were all classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10", "E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 284 units at 14.5 units per day, providing 20 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The best option by rule is to buy from NuCare Pharmaceuticals, Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today and whose plant last received an NAI inspection on 2025-03-12.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    }
  ]
}
